OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition tech to be used
OL,4,Aat festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FLive Facial Recognition (LFR)
OL,7,Ftechnology will be used at Leeds
OL,8,FFestival for the first time this year
OL,9,Fto help prevent crime and keep
OL,10,Frevellers safe.
OL,12,FThe technology - which compares live
OL,13,Fcamera images against a watchlist of
OL,14,Fwanted or dangerous individuals - will
OL,15,Fbe deployed around the perimeter of the
OL,16,Ffestival, and any "alerts" would be
OL,17,Fdealt with by specialist officers, West
OL,18,FYorkshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
