OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition tech to be used
OL,4,Aat festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds Festival will take place between
OL,7,F26 and 30 August at Bramham Park and is
OL,8,Fattended by up to 90,000 people every
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FA force spokesperson said it wanted to
OL,12,F"work in partnership to identify those
OL,13,Fwho might seek to use the event as an
OL,14,Fopportunity to commit crime or cause
OL,15,Fharm".
